{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 203,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        208.6681365966797,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Treatment administration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.439208984375,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "Community-based or home-based treatment support has more advantages than health facility-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966499328613281,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.3685302734375,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "treatment support, although family members should not be the first or only option for administering",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.4364624023438,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "treatment support. Treatment support is better provided at home or in the community by trained",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.4058227539062,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "lay providers or health-care workers. However, there may be challenges in providing community- or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        524.4192504882812,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "home-based treatment support by health-care workers because of the increased number of health-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        527.4509887695312,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "care workers required and the increased costs for staff time and daily travel to the community or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        169.02272033691406,
        527.3772583007812,
        183.46571350097656
      ],
      "text": "to a patient’s home. Treatment support provided in the community or at home by trained local lay",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        182.2227325439453,
        527.2396240234375,
        196.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "persons is more feasible. A combination of lay provider and health-care worker for provision of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.42274475097656,
        527.4605102539062,
        209.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "community- or home-based treatment support is also an option. Community-based or home-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993047714233398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.62269592285156,
        527.5972290039062,
        223.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "treatment support is more likely to be acceptable and accessible to patients than other forms of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.8227081298828,
        524.4358520507812,
        236.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "treatment support. Nevertheless, stigma may continue to be a concern with community- or home-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.02272033691406,
        527.4354248046875,
        249.46571350097656
      ],
      "text": "based treatment support. Having a health-care worker coming regularly to a patient’s house may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.2227325439453,
        527.4287719726562,
        262.6657409667969
      ],
      "text": "be stigmatizing, and the feeling of being “watched over” may be disempowering to patients. Other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.4227294921875,
        527.4321899414062,
        275.8657531738281
      ],
      "text": "forms of treatment support (e.g. administered by an emotionally supportive relative or close friend)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.6226806640625,
        318.4949035644531,
        289.0657043457031
      ],
      "text": "may be more acceptable but may still be stigmatizing.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.32672119140625,
        527.1671142578125,
        310.7697448730469
      ],
      "text": "Given complex family social dynamics, family members may not always be the best people to supervise",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949685096740723,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        309.526611328125,
        527.4222412109375,
        323.9696350097656
      ],
      "text": "treatment, so the suitability of such treatment adherence supervisors needs to be carefully analysed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.7265930175781,
        527.421142578125,
        337.16961669921875
      ],
      "text": "in each national or local context. If family members are already providing treatment support, careful",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.9266052246094,
        527.4014892578125,
        350.36962890625
      ],
      "text": "identification and training of those persons is required. Additional supervision of local supporters or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.1266174316406,
        527.5980834960938,
        363.56964111328125
      ],
      "text": "health-care workers is still needed, as family members cannot be depended on as the only option for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990896224975586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.3266906738281,
        527.3816528320312,
        376.76971435546875
      ],
      "text": "care. Patients will continue to need social support, even if family members are providing treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.526611328125,
        109.33859252929688,
        389.9696350097656
      ],
      "text": "support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.2305908203125,
        527.4520263671875,
        411.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "Assessment of potential risk factors for poor adherence must be taken into account by health-care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        410.43060302734375,
        527.4937744140625,
        424.8736267089844
      ],
      "text": "workers at the start of a patient’s treatment in order to decide which treatment administration option",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999699592590332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.630615234375,
        527.1149291992188,
        438.0736389160156
      ],
      "text": "should be selected for that patient. Some groups of patients who are less likely to adhere to treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975873947143555,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        436.8305969238281,
        527.4353637695312,
        451.27362060546875
      ],
      "text": "may gain more benefit from treatment support than others do. Another factor to consider when",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.0306091308594,
        527.2276000976562,
        464.4736328125
      ],
      "text": "selecting options for treatment administration is that some patients with inflexible work or family",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        463.2305908203125,
        527.4266357421875,
        477.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "responsibilities may not be able to provide treatment support. Any treatment administration option",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.43060302734375,
        527.5253295898438,
        490.8736267089844
      ],
      "text": "offered to a patient must also be provided in conjunction with proper medical care, including regular",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99940013885498,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        489.630615234375,
        527.4234008789062,
        504.0736389160156
      ],
      "text": "pick-up of TB drugs, consultations with a physician or other health-care workers when necessary, TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.83056640625,
        524.3204956054688,
        517.2735595703125
      ],
      "text": "treatment that is free of charge, and provision to the patient of essential information on TB treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98739242553711,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.6477661132812,
        220.46530151367188,
        546.4998168945312
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        553.707763671875,
        527.4278564453125,
        568.1507568359375
      ],
      "text": "Programmes should attempt to measure whether the provision of incentives improves programme",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.90771484375,
        132.5749969482422,
        581.3507080078125
      ],
      "text": "performance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.3389892578125,
        507.4425354003906,
        620.1339721679688
      ],
      "text": "2. Models of care for people with drug-resistant TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.6741943359375,
        259.864501953125,
        652.55419921875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations 2.1–2.2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        664.2596435546875,
        200.94850158691406,
        678.6146240234375
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        685.8742065429688,
        491.33099365234375,
        700.4271850585938
      ],
      "text": "2.1 Patients with MDR-TB should be treated using mainly ambulatory care rather than",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        697.9841918945312,
        349.9084167480469,
        712.4271850585938
      ],
      "text": "models of care based principally on hospitalization.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        712.960205078125,
        389.42132568359375,
        728.6242065429688
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        735.7408447265625,
        505.849853515625,
        750.2938232421875
      ],
      "text": "2.2 A decentralized model of care is recommended over a centralized model for patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        747.850830078125,
        219.75738525390625,
        762.2938232421875
      ],
      "text": "on MDR-TB treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        762.8267211914062,
        389.42132568359375,
        778.49072265625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323.2414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3 Tuberculosis care and support: Recommendations 189",
